Package: stdmatern
Type: Package
Title: Standardised Matern Gaussian Fields and Copulas on Rectangular Grids
Version: 0.3.0
Date: 2026-09-02
Authors@R: person("Brynjolfur Gauti", "Gudrunar Jonsson", email = "brynjolfur@hi.is", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Sparse precision matrices, densities, samplers and a maximum-likelihood
    fit for the standardised anisotropic Matern-like Gaussian field and its Gaussian
    copula on rectangular grids, built from the eigen systems of two AR(1)
    precision matrices (RcppEigen). All numerical work is single-threaded and
    reproducible from a seed; the fit runs nlopt's BOBYQA through the 'nloptr'
    package. Developed for the copula-extended Max-and-Smooth inference stack.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/bgautijonsson/stdmatern
